{"text": "# Calculating 34462116119303 mod 650\n\nI need to find the remainder when 34462116119303 is divided by 650.\n\n## Step-by-step Division\n\nI'll use long division, breaking this into manageable chunks:\n\n**Finding the quotient and remainder:**\n\n- 650 \u00d7 50,000,000,000 = 32,500,000,000,000\n  - Remainder: 34,462,116,119,303 - 32,500,000,000,000 = 1,962,116,119,303\n\n- 650 \u00d7 3,000,000,000 = 1,950,000,000,000\n  - Remainder: 1,962,116,119,303 - 1,950,000,000,000 = 12,116,119,303\n\n- 650 \u00d7 18,000,000 = 11,700,000,000\n  - Remainder: 12,116,119,303 - 11,700,000,000 = 416,119,303\n\n- 650 \u00d7 600,000 = 390,000,000\n  - Remainder: 416,119,303 - 390,000,000 = 26,119,303\n\n- 650 \u00d7 40,000 = 26,000,000\n  - Remainder: 26,119,303 - 26,000,000 = 119,303\n\n- 650 \u00d7 183 = 118,950\n  - Remainder: 119,303 - 118,950 = **353**\n\n## Verification\n\nQuotient: 50,000,000,000 + 3,000,000,000 + 18,000,000 + 600,000 + 40,000 + 183 = 53,018,640,183\n\nCheck: 650 \u00d7 53,018,640,183 + 353 = 34,462,116,118,950 + 353 = 34,462,116,119,303 \u2713\n\n**ANSWER: 353**", "usage": {"calls": 1, "input_tokens": 1237, "output_tokens": 2580, "cost_usd": 0.014136999999999999, "latency_s": 22.389476537704468}, "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "stop_reason": "end_turn"}